{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302020","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130202001:1":{"text":"상록수 학회에서 트라이브를 연구한 유명 학자가 되어 학계의 존경을 받겠죠.","source_cn":"我就会成为冬青会研究蛮血的著名学者，享有学会最崇高的敬意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E92F016E8D170A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130202002:1":{"text":"그리고 제가 가는 곳마다 상록수 학자들의 존경 어린 시선이 뒤따를 거예요.","source_cn":"无论我走到哪里，冬青会的学者们都会对我行礼致意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA724B4CA8A8ED56A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130202003:1":{"text":"그래서... 크흠, 제가 뭐부터 해야 한다고 했었죠?","source_cn":"免礼……咳咳，我首先要干什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7EBBEA3F22075A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者瑞韦恩":{"text":"상록수 학자 레베인","source":"冬青学者瑞韦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}